WEBVTT

00:11:58.346 --> 00:12:02.839
for the fearless way
in which you have led us all forward,

00:12:02.863 --> 00:12:07.450
and one last next step
for moving onward from you?

00:12:07.474 --> 00:12:09.585
What advice or counsel?

00:12:11.363 --> 00:12:12.513
GS: Ah.

00:12:14.030 --> 00:12:15.529
Just do it.

00:12:15.831 --> 00:12:16.981
(Laughs)

00:12:17.005 --> 00:12:21.738
You know, I think we kind of wait
for instructions from up there,

00:12:21.762 --> 00:12:24.222
or we worry or something,

00:12:24.246 --> 00:12:29.141
and you know, if we just get up
in the morning and say,

00:12:29.165 --> 00:12:31.125
"OK, I'm going to do this,